---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = 'About';
const description = 'I help students, renters, and small-space dwellers build ergonomic workspaces on a budget.';
const permalink = `${Astro.site.href}about`;
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} permalink={permalink} current="about">
  <div class="container">
    <h1>About This Blog</h1>

    <p><strong>I've been there. Cramped desk. Aching neck. No space to work properly.</strong></p>

    <p>This blog is my collection of solutions for people who work in small spaces, on tight budgets, or in rental apartments. No fluff. No expensive gear you don't need. Just practical, science-backed fixes that actually work.</p>

    <p>I research real problems—Reddit threads, Amazon reviews, and real user experiences—and share what I find. If it saves your back and your desk space, I'll write about it.</p>

    <p><strong>You don't need a huge desk. You just need the right setup.</strong></p>

    <p>Welcome to the small desk club. Let's fix your setup.</p>

    <hr style="margin: 2.5rem 0; border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #2a2a2a;" />

    <h2>About This Site</h2>

    <p>This blog focuses on three specific workspace challenges:</p>

    <ul>
      <li><strong>Extreme Small Space Workstation</strong> — Solutions for tiny desks, compact gear, and vertical space.</li>
      <li><strong>Ultra-Budget Student Workspace</strong> — Best gear under $150, Amazon basics, and DIY hacks.</li>
      <li><strong>No-Damage Setup for Renters</strong> — Clamp-on, adhesive, and freestanding products that leave zero marks.</li>
    </ul>

    <p>Every recommendation comes from real research. I read the reviews. I check the ratings. I verify the products actually work before I share them.</p>

    <hr style="margin: 2.5rem 0; border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #2a2a2a;" />

    <h2>Affiliate Disclosure</h2>

    <p>Some links on this site are affiliate links. This means if you click and buy something, I earn a small commission at no extra cost to you.</p>

    <p>I only recommend products I genuinely believe in—products that solve real problems for small-space workers, students, and renters. Your trust matters more than a quick sale.</p>

    <p>As an Amazon Associate, I earn from qualifying purchases.</p>

    <hr style="margin: 2.5rem 0; border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #2a2a2a;" />

    <p style="font-style: italic; color: #8b8f96;">— Blueprintly</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-image {
    float: right;
    margin: -3em -7em 2em 2em;
    max-width: 300px;
  }

  .about-image img {
    border-radius: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 1.5em;
  }

  .about-image figcaption {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: #6b7280;
  }

  .about-image figcaption a {
    color: #9ca3af;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .about-image figcaption a:hover {
    color: #d1d5db;
  }

  ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding-left: 0;
    margin: 1.2rem 0 1.8rem 0;
  }

  ul li {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 1.6rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
    color: #d1d5db;
  }

  ul li::before {
    content: "▹";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: #6b7280;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }

  hr {
    margin: 2.5rem 0;
    border: 0;
    border-top: 1px solid #2a2a2a;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1020px) {
    .about-image {
      float: none;
      margin: 0 auto 2em;
      max-width: 250px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .about-image {
      max-width: 200px;
    }
  }
</style>
